OL,3,GNEWSALong delays following lorry fire
OL,4,Aon M25
OL,5,
OL,6,FMotorists faced long delays after a
OL,7,Florry fire on the M25 in Surrey,
OL,8,Faccording to travel monitoring site
OL,9,FInrix.
OL,11,FTwo lanes were closed on the
OL,12,Fanti-clockwise carriageway between
OL,13,Fjunction 13 for Staines and the M3
OL,14,F(junction 12) after the incident which
OL,15,Fwas reported just before 06:30 GMT on
OL,16,FThursday.
OL,18,FAll lanes were reopened at about 08:20,
OL,19,Fbut with delays of up to about 40
OL,20,Fminutes affecting traffic back to
OL,21,Fjunction 14 for Heathrow.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
